OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA wet and
OL,6,Fwindy evening across the region. Rain
OL,7,Fclearing to blustery showers through
OL,8,Fthe early hours, these heavy at times.
OL,9,FStrong winds persisting along the
OL,10,Fcoast. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FFrequent blustery showers
OL,13,Fpersist on Tuesday, heavy and perhaps
OL,14,Fthundery at times. Some brighter
OL,15,Fspells may develop later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
